Sure, I can help you create a WordPress plugin to accomplish this task. Here's a step-by-step guide to creating the plugin:

Step 1: Create a new folder in the `wp-content/plugins` directory and name it `text-splitter`.

Step 2: Create a new PHP file inside the `text-splitter` folder and name it `text-splitter.php`.

Step 3: Add the following code to the `text-splitter.php` file to create the plugin header:

```php
<?php
/*
Plugin Name: Text Splitter
Plugin URI: https://yourwebsite.com/
Description: A plugin to split large text into multiple WordPress posts
Version: 1.0
Author: Your Name
Author URI: https://yourwebsite.com/
