The plugin will split the text into multiple posts based on the word count, with each post having the relevant headers inside the post so that all the posts from the original text are related to each other. The form is accessible through the WordPress admin area, and the content of each post is structured so that the data that is split across the multiple created posts will be related to each other. The data will later be sent over to Pinecone.io for semantic search.
